      "content": "wait 2.5ml seems like a tiny amount for a 4 year old. he's acting really lethargic and his fever is still climbing. are you sure that's enough to actually help him? i feel like i should give him more if he's this sick so it actually works. how much can i safely give him at once if he's really struggling?",
